 / Resistance Index</span>\n                <div className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-red-400 mt-1\">95.0%</div>\n                <p className=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1\">\n                  Convoy verified carrying automatic weapons and military-grade body armor.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div className=\"p-3 rounded bg-cyan-950/30 border border-cyan-500/40 text-xs text-slate-200 space-y-2 leading-relaxed font-sans\">\n              <div className=\"font-mono text-cyan-300 font-bold text-[11px] uppercase\">\n                Tactical Interdiction Recommendation:\n              </div>\n              <p>\n                Target is actively staging logistics for imminent Black Sea maritime transit. Recommend immediate coordination with Romanian Border Police and Europol FAST team for coordinated vehicle interdiction at Highway E81 checkpoint before maritime departure.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </Card>\n        </TabsContent>\n      </Tabs>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n","Description":"Create EntityProfilePage with deep-dive intelligence tabs, associates, financial conduits, and AI risk synthesis","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Nityam Jaiswal\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\nexus\\src\\pages\\EntityProfilePage.tsx","toolAction":"Creating pages/EntityProfilePage.tsx","toolSummary":"Create EntityProfilePage component"}}]}
